Comment: 0,0:00:02.76,0:00:06.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{Sign TS: YOMOGI PRESCHOOL}
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,TL:Giggle, TLC:ItAintEazy, TI:Zarharva, TS:Yuuri, ED: Keeper, EN:, QC:Dooms RC:
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:10.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato Ep 7
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.74,0:00:12.83,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.91,0:00:17.99,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Those have broken too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.08,0:00:21.62,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,It’d probably be better to buy new ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.13,0:00:25.28,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,They can still be fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.28,0:00:28.31,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,There’s no reason to buy new ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.98,0:00:32.23,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,How’s college?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.23,0:00:34.37,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing special.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.37,0:00:35.89,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.89,0:00:37.37,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Are you getting all your credits?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.07,0:00:39.57,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.57,0:00:40.92,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,That’s good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.51,0:00:45.49,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-kun, you do nothing but work all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.55,0:00:49.28,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.28,0:00:50.55,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Good morn…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.44,0:00:53.48,KM,Yoshio,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan fell down again!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.48,0:00:55.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Geez, you’re such a klutz!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.24,0:00:57.49,KM,Yoshio,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right, Kobato-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.40,0:00:57.49,KO,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Geez…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.49,0:01:00.66,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,How come you always fall down\Nwhen there’s nothing in your way?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.70,0:01:05.60,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ow…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.19,0:01:09.08,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Opening
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,Title,0000,0000,0000,,A Kind Person
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.80,0:02:49.39,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.81,0:02:54.06,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m going to help you. Please let me help!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.90,0:02:56.23,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,If you want to…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.20,0:02:58.15,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.78,0:03:06.28,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, Fujimoto-san…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.12,0:03:11.38,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There’s something I’d like to ask you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.34,0:03:14.58,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.58,0:03:16.72,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it. Just keep moving your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.72,0:03:19.22,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,If you have time to talk, then you aren’t busy enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.22,0:03:20.54,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.49,0:03:24.36,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.36,0:03:25.01,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.49,0:03:28.02,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What did you want to ask me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.02,0:03:29.41,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.97,0:03:35.35,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um, it’s about the strange call from the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.09,0:03:40.44,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Why can’t we tell Sayaka-sensei about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.72,0:03:43.65,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,We just can’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.65,0:03:46.22,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But why can’t we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.29,0:03:50.24,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,If you can’t keep quiet about it, then don’t come here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.41,0:03:57.17,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,If you tell her, she'll suffer for it... That’s why.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.17,0:04:00.54,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei will… suffer?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.96,0:04:19.06,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to help or do you just want to get in the way? Which is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.89,0:04:27.78,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,What’s wrong, Kobato-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.17,0:04:32.66,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I made Fujimoto-san mad again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.66,0:04:34.06,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Made him mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.06,0:04:35.18,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.18,0:04:38.92,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,All I do is get in the way of Fujimoto-san’s work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.31,0:04:43.10,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Then you should apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.10,0:04:45.33,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,We can go apologize together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,Stop! The paint is still wet, so don’t touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.14,0:05:05.35,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sure he only got angry\Nbecause he’s worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.35,0:05:06.86,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if that‘s true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.86,0:05:08.62,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Of course it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.62,0:05:09.68,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Cheer up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.68,0:05:13.33,KM,Yoshio,0000,0000,0000,,He’s angry because he wants you to be a good kid. That’s what my Mama always says.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.76,0:05:19.72,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, of course. If I apologize, I think he’ll let me help again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.73,0:05:22.53,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.53,0:05:24.18,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,He’s not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.37,0:05:31.44,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.14,0:05:35.77,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, this is probably Fujimoto-kun’s report.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.77,0:05:37.40,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Report?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.40,0:05:40.10,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if he needs it today…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.10,0:05:42.50,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Could you take it to him for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.50,0:05:44.64,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.64,0:05:46.95,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,He’ll be in trouble without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.95,0:05:49.45,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll take it to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.33,0:05:56.83,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What’s going on? You’re in a good mood today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.17,0:06:03.07,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I want to show him that I don’t always get in the way, that I even can be useful sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.65,0:06:09.85,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The university that Fujimoto-san attends is around here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.85,0:06:12.43,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Didn’t you listen to the directions carefully?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.43,0:06:13.80,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.80,0:06:15.93,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But what’s a university?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.95,0:06:19.82,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You didn’t know something like that, yet you went anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.82,0:06:24.19,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I guess I shouldn’t be surprised by your lack of common knowledge anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.60,0:06:28.69,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,A university is where you engage in all sorts of difficult studies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.69,0:06:30.19,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Studies?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.19,0:06:31.15,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.15,0:06:34.70,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Like things you want to do or if there’s a job you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.70,0:06:36.62,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Things you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.97,0:06:44.79,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,People… there are so many people!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.79,0:06:47.67,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It’s a university, of course there’ll be many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.60,0:06:51.47,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder how many Yomogi Preschools this makes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.47,0:06:52.78,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You can’t compare that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.94,0:06:57.91,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Just look for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.91,0:07:00.12,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, Ioryogi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.38,0:07:03.27,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.17,0:07:08.20,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.81,0:07:14.72,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,E-Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.00,0:07:19.83,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Eh… um… oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.83,0:07:22.12,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.31,0:07:27.35,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,We couldn’t find Fujimoto-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.35,0:07:30.97,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You walked aimlessly around the campus, of course we couldn’t find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.41,0:07:35.64,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m going to do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.83,0:07:36.64,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.66,0:07:39.10,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s Fujimoto-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.94,0:07:46.55,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you just standing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.91,0:07:52.07,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That’s right! If I don’t give this to him…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.15,0:07:56.64,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You’re going to fall down again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.91,0:08:04.38,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry. Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.38,0:08:05.64,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.08,0:08:08.90,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Me too! I’m so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.90,0:08:11.27,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t worry about it, I’m fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.27,0:08:14.27,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,It’s a cute stuffed animal. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.27,0:08:16.26,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.26,0:08:19.80,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,This is… Are you a friend of Kiyokazu?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.80,0:08:20.43,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.43,0:08:25.09,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No, we’re not friends but…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.09,0:08:26.49,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,You want to see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.49,0:08:28.66,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.57,0:08:30.44,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.21,0:08:32.44,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.44,0:08:36.22,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I’m Doumoto Takashi. And you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.22,0:08:39.15,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Nice to meet you! I’m Hanato Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.15,0:08:42.64,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I came to bring Fujimoto-san something he had forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.64,0:08:44.08,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.54,0:08:49.61,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He was here just a second ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.61,0:08:51.46,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like he escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.37,0:08:55.74,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I made him mad earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.74,0:08:57.46,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.46,0:08:58.30,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,“Again?”
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.30,0:09:01.22,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He gets mad really easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.22,0:09:06.28,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But it’s because I’m always messing things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.28,0:09:09.58,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But I think he gets way too mad at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.06,0:09:15.46,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But I’m always at fault. It’s never his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.27,0:09:22.84,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, from Yomogi Preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.84,0:09:25.70,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! I’m helping out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.11,0:09:29.94,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Well, let’s look for Kiyokazu together, Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.94,0:09:32.61,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,For Fujimoto-san? Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.95,0:09:34.79,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Would I be in the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.79,0:09:37.59,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No, not at all. You’d be a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.10,0:09:39.45,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,That’s good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.86,0:10:01.70,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,At this time, he’s probably in the Legal Philosophy class.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.30,0:10:05.70,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,It’s all right. He’ll be on campus all day today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.89,0:10:09.08,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,He finally took a day off from work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.08,0:10:10.95,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.95,0:10:12.87,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,It’s almost exam time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.87,0:10:17.06,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san always seems so busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.06,0:10:18.32,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,That’s true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.42,0:10:24.39,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,He doesn’t take all the classes he wants because work comes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.82,0:10:28.17,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,But that’s just like Kiyokazu, isn’t it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.70,0:10:31.94,KM,Girl 1,0000,0000,0000,,Doumoto-kun! We have a request.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.94,0:10:32.69,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.69,0:10:34.49,KM,Girl 1,0000,0000,0000,,We want your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.49,0:10:38.13,KM,Girl 2,0000,0000,0000,,We don’t know where to start on Professor Hayakawa’s report.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.59,0:10:41.31,KM,Girl 2,0000,0000,0000,,And suddenly we only have until next week. Isn’t that terrible?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.31,0:10:43.61,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I get it, I get it. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.61,0:10:44.59,KM,Girl 1,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.59,0:10:46.24,KM,Girl 2,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Doumoto-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.24,0:10:50.44,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I help, the work still has to be your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.44,0:10:51.85,KM,Girl 1,0000,0000,0000,,We understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.85,0:10:53.38,KM,Girl 2,0000,0000,0000,,We’ll be in your care.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.86,0:10:55.35,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Oh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.45,0:10:57.77,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,So, let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.75,0:11:01.53,KM,Man 1,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto? I haven’t seen him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.53,0:11:03.34,KM,Man 1,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe he’s at the library?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.78,0:11:09.61,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks. If you see him, could you tell him I’m looking for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.61,0:11:10.56,KM,Man 2,0000,0000,0000,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.05,0:11:14.35,KM,Man 1,0000,0000,0000,,He’s not very sociable and he’s kinda scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.35,0:11:15.84,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.84,0:11:17.69,KM,Man 1,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, he’s really difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.31,0:11:25.38,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is everyone scared of Fujimoto-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.07,0:11:31.96,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,He’s not very sociable because he always looks angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.96,0:11:33.53,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,How about you, Doumoto-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.53,0:11:34.23,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.23,0:11:37.45,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Earlier, you said you made him mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.64,0:11:42.21,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu has his reasons for being angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.79,0:11:46.71,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,For a long time, he was the type who needed everyone’s help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.58,0:11:52.45,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,But I sort of gave him some advice on his future.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.30,0:11:57.56,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I knew I shouldn’t have said it, but I did anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.56,0:11:59.23,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.23,0:12:00.18,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.21,0:12:06.16,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I guess because I just can’t leave him be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.90,0:12:09.83,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.83,0:12:11.09,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.09,0:12:12.62,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone’s waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.62,0:12:14.66,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry and come play!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.04,0:12:21.09,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry. Fujimoto-kun and Kobato-chan are both gone today, so it’s boring, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.09,0:12:23.59,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, ah, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.11,0:12:27.22,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Just wait a bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.22,0:12:29.05,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.63,0:12:31.48,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,It’s a guest!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.60,0:12:34.73,KM,Chiho and Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Good afternoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.73,0:12:37.35,KM,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,It’s Chiho-san and Chise-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.24,0:12:41.15,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Chitose, what’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.15,0:12:42.12,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,You see…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.12,0:12:45.22,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,The three of us made macarons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.22,0:12:47.99,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,So we thought we’d share with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.99,0:12:48.93,KM,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.28,0:12:50.07,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,My…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.55,0:12:52.91,KM,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Itadakimasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.91,0:12:54.49,KM,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.49,0:12:55.91,KM,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,They’re so crispy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.94,0:13:00.40,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka, where are Kiyokazu-kun and Kobato-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.40,0:13:03.55,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Today, both of them are at the university.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.19,0:13:05.80,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.88,0:13:09.68,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto? He just left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.68,0:13:12.38,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I see. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.38,0:13:13.68,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,We’ll try looking elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.27,0:13:15.37,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Doumoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.51,0:13:18.98,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,You get along with Professor Tomita, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.43,0:13:22.08,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,It’ll be bad if I can’t get the credits this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.08,0:13:23.78,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Could you talk to him for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.78,0:13:25.36,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Have you tried yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.36,0:13:27.75,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,No, it’d feel awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.75,0:13:31.62,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,It’d be better if you did first…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.18,0:13:34.28,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I understand. I’ll put in a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.28,0:13:36.45,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Really? I owe you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.01,0:13:38.43,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,But you’ll have to talk to the Professor too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.58,0:13:43.09,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\fscx(92)}Everyone really relies on Doumoto-san, right, Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.58,0:13:41.59,KO,Man,0000,0000,0000,,{\fscx(92)}Okay, I got it. Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.19,0:13:46.59,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.59,0:13:47.83,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.83,0:13:49.59,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.32,0:13:52.18,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Could we stop by somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.18,0:13:53.78,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.35,0:14:00.82,KM,Tomita,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you ask, there aren’t any seats left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.82,0:14:02.98,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,It’s been really worrying him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.98,0:14:06.22,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Please think about it, Professor Tomita.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.33,0:14:11.19,KM,Tomita,0000,0000,0000,,I understand, but only because you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.19,0:14:12.59,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.55,0:14:17.95,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.95,0:14:19.79,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Doumoto-san, you’re amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.79,0:14:22.46,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing? How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.46,0:14:27.35,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Many people rely on you and you help them a lot too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.35,0:14:28.79,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.79,0:14:29.70,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.20,0:14:36.04,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I want to be helpful to everyone but there isn’t much I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.04,0:14:38.06,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That’s why you’re amazing, Doumoto-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.24,0:14:42.81,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if I should thank you or not…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.81,0:14:43.81,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.81,0:14:48.11,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,It’s nothing. Shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.11,0:14:49.42,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.05,0:14:52.23,KM,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,It’s a tie!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.54,0:14:55.01,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, I lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.01,0:14:57.18,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Chiho-chan’s it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.18,0:14:59.27,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Okay everyone, let’s go hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.05,0:15:05.33,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,One… two…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.92,0:15:08.83,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so? That’s why she went to the university.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.16,0:15:12.13,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan is very energetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.13,0:15:14.04,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,It’s so like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.20,0:15:18.30,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka, could you look at this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.68,0:15:21.75,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Yukari-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.25,0:15:24.39,KM,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Chise-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.87,0:15:28.02,KM,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.28,0:15:33.13,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Yukari-chan, I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.13,0:15:35.37,KM,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,You were Chiho-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.68,0:15:40.50,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,This is from someone who is\Nable to discuss your financing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.02,0:15:43.46,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,This is from an accountant I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.46,0:15:45.66,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,And this is…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.66,0:15:47.58,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Chitose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.63,0:15:50.83,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka, do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.91,0:15:56.72,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,I’m not helping you out of pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.72,0:16:02.37,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,I want to protect Yomogi Preschool\Nbecause Chiho, Chise and I all went here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.82,0:16:05.89,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,So you shouldn’t apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.40,0:16:09.61,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.70,0:16:16.18,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Finally, there he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.03,0:16:18.28,KM,Girl 3,0000,0000,0000,,What’s with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.79,0:16:23.41,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You’re skipping class, aren’t you?\NI don’t want to help people like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.41,0:16:27.30,KM,Girl 4,0000,0000,0000,,Why? If you don’t want to help\Npeople, you should just say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.30,0:16:29.00,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, I don’t want to. I refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.76,0:16:31.38,KM,Girl 4,0000,0000,0000,,Fine then!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.35,0:16:35.24,KM,Girl 3,0000,0000,0000,,We shouldn’t have asked him anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.39,0:16:41.31,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.94,0:16:43.68,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san, you’re terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.68,0:16:45.16,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.16,0:16:48.45,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You didn’t have to be so mean to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.45,0:16:51.27,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Saying those things just to make them mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.27,0:16:53.80,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,That’s not it. They were just trying to cheat again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.80,0:16:56.52,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Those people could have had\Ncircumstances we didn’t know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.52,0:17:00.63,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn’t matter. Mind your own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.62,0:17:05.93,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You forgot this. I brought it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.12,0:17:13.23,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.76,0:17:24.20,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I can’t believe I said something like that…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.80,0:17:27.91,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.25,0:17:30.82,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Doumoto-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.82,0:17:36.62,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I forgot to thank you for\Nhelping me look for Fujimoto-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.62,0:17:38.85,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um, I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.85,0:17:40.79,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.70,0:17:48.14,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,How long have you known Kiyokazu?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.84,0:17:52.37,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um, since this spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.37,0:17:53.29,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.04,0:17:55.55,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What’s the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.18,0:17:58.50,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I was just a bit jealous…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.50,0:17:59.43,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.43,0:18:01.24,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,…of you and Kiyokazu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.52,0:18:04.88,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Of me and Fujimoto-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.51,0:18:12.77,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I’ve known him longer but I\Ncan’t talk to him like you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.77,0:18:17.54,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I think I must have really hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.54,0:18:20.09,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I said some really rude things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.09,0:18:22.53,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,No, you weren’t wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.03,0:18:25.26,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,What you said was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.72,0:18:29.37,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,But I can never tell him the truth like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.39,0:18:34.26,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I’m being too wishful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.26,0:18:38.55,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But there are many other wonderful things about you, Doumoto-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.55,0:18:40.77,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Like your kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.77,0:18:42.52,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I’m not really that kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.53,0:18:48.85,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? But listening to everyone’s requests\Nand then using your power to help is kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.85,0:18:50.03,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,About that,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.03,0:18:52.39,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,it’s just difficult for me to refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.93,0:18:55.32,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I still think about others but the truth is,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.32,0:18:58.54,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I really should turn them down like Kiyokazu does.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.74,0:19:05.78,KP,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(188,306)}You’re skipping class, aren’t you?\NI don’t want to help people like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.32,0:19:11.83,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu is not afraid of being hated. He’s a strong person.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.75,0:19:17.62,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,The people around him keep away because he displays such strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.41,0:19:21.95,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I’m jealous of that strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.87,0:19:25.82,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Jealous of his strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.69,0:19:28.80,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.73,0:19:37.21,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t know very much about Fujimoto-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.80,0:19:40.67,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,...but being scary must be lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.17,0:19:43.82,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It must be tough having people hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.24,0:19:49.62,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The people we met today, you helped them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.62,0:19:50.89,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,They looked so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.30,0:19:52.63,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,But that’s{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.63,0:19:54.25,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Doumoto-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.62,0:19:58.31,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is it wrong to not want to be hated?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.81,0:20:02.51,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is it wrong to want the love of others?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.96,0:20:06.51,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is it wrong to simply help people?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.51,0:20:10.97,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is it wrong to want to do something for those who are in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.18,0:20:15.73,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I can’t say it well, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.73,0:20:19.00,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You’re a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.43,0:20:26.60,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.60,0:20:27.42,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.33,0:20:31.40,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,You’re a curious girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.35,0:20:36.01,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,D-Did I say something weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.01,0:20:40.42,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Because I don’t know anything, I’m always making Ioryogi-san angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.42,0:20:42.30,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.30,0:20:45.68,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! Ioryogi-san is a stuffed animal but he can talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.11,0:20:48.80,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He can talk but I’m not allowed to speak to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.80,0:20:49.68,KT,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.14,0:20:52.21,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,That stuffed animal is Ioryogi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.21,0:20:53.11,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.11,0:20:54.62,KM,Girl 2,0000,0000,0000,,Doumoto-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.09,0:20:56.46,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,From before…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.23,0:20:58.50,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I guess…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.50,0:21:01.15,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.92,0:21:04.15,KM,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I should be thanking you. See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.15,0:21:05.52,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.71,0:21:09.27,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.27,0:21:11.78,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Why is there more confetti?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.13,0:21:16.87,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It’s because you appreciated how kind that stud muffin is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.87,0:21:20.77,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,“Stud muffin”… You mean Doumoto-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.77,0:21:22.21,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Was there anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.21,0:21:25.67,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But, I got confetti just for appreciating him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.67,0:21:30.20,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If it’s what the other person is looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.20,0:21:32.27,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.27,0:21:36.82,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, stud muffins also have their own problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.05,0:21:39.99,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, Dobato…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.99,0:21:41.65,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,About this afternoon…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.99,0:21:43.23,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.23,0:21:46.99,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you tell him about me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.99,0:21:50.99,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But I did as you said and didn’t talk to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.55,0:21:55.99,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Nobody would believe in a talking stuffed animal or talking to a stuffed animal!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.99,0:21:58.01,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.23,0:21:59.01,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.82,0:22:01.04,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,30 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.04,0:22:02.65,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ehh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.88,0:22:06.24,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,800)}No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.31,0:22:08.05,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.04,0:22:11.25,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I’m just saying, you were a lifesaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.23,0:22:18.16,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Fujimoto-kun. The same as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.70,0:22:22.23,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,He really is awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.23,0:22:24.94,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,That was him, thanking you with all his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.16,0:22:26.42,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thanking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.94,0:22:31.24,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan! Kiyokazu-sensei isn’t mad anymore, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.24,0:22:34.66,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,He’s not scary. He’s really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.68,0:22:40.64,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, he is. When I lost the\Nkey to my house, he found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.64,0:22:42.43,KM,Yoshio,0000,0000,0000,,And he made me a bamboo dragonfly!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.80,0:22:45.30,KM,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,And he gave me a cicada shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.71,0:22:47.40,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,He’s not a bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.24,0:22:56.03,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What a strange person, Fujimoto-san is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The Kitten’s Lullaby
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
